    <h2>3. Not a commitment to lend</h2>
    <p>Rates, payments, quotes, pre-qualifications, calculators, home values, equity and cash flow estimates, and other information on the Services are estimates for information only. They are not a commitment to lend, an offer of credit, a rate lock, an appraisal, or tax, legal or financial advice. Loans are subject to application, credit and income approval, underwriting, property appraisal and program guidelines. Rates, terms and programs may change without notice and vary by state. Not all applicants will qualify.</p>

    <h2>4. License to use</h2>
    <p>We grant you a limited, personal, non-transferable, revocable license to use the Services for your own mortgage, real estate and financial planning purposes. You may not copy, resell, scrape, frame or redistribute the Services or their content, use bots or automated tools against them, attempt to access accounts or data that are not yours, or interfere with their security or operation.</p>

    <h2>5. Your account and the app</h2>
    <p>You are responsible for the accuracy of information you provide and for keeping your login, password and verification codes secure. You may use the app only on devices you own or control. We may suspend or close accounts that violate these Terms or put other users at risk. When you connect bank accounts through Plaid or use other third-party features, their terms also apply. For apps downloaded from the Apple App Store, Apple is not responsible for the app or its support, and Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these Terms.</p>
    <p><strong>Connecting with other people.</strong> The app lets you connect with loan officers, real estate investors, agents and other professionals. We verify identity to help keep the community safe, but we do not guarantee the conduct, advice or services of any other person or business. Use your own judgment before meeting or doing business with anyone.</p>

