    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Arizona and applicable federal law, without regard to conflict-of-law rules. Any dispute relating to the Services will be resolved in the state or federal courts located in Maricopa County, Arizona, where our corporate office is located at 5559 S Sossaman Rd, Bldg 1, Ste 101, Mesa, AZ 85212, unless the law of your state requires otherwise.</p>

