      <li><strong>HELOCs and second mortgages:</strong> your home secures the loan; failure to repay may result in foreclosure. Rates may be variable.</li>
      <li><strong>Construction, renovation and bridge loans:</strong> subject to additional requirements, draw schedules and reserves.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>17. Security and vulnerability reporting</h2>
    <p>We use safeguards such as encryption and firewalls. To report a security vulnerability, email <a href="mailto:info@nexamortgage.com">info@nexamortgage.com</a> or <a href="mailto:privacy@stairwaymortgage.com">privacy@stairwaymortgage.com</a> with &ldquo;Vulnerability Disclosure&rdquo; in the subject line. Do not access, change or delete data that is not yours while testing.</p>

