    <p>Residents of other states: see our <a href="/state-licensing/">State Licensing</a> page for state-specific notices.</p>

    <h2>19. Equal Housing Opportunity and fair lending</h2>
    <p>NEXA Mortgage LLC dba Stairway Mortgage is an Equal Housing Opportunity company and Equal Housing Lender. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, handicap or disability, familial status, marital status, age (provided the applicant can enter a contract), because all or part of the applicant&rsquo;s income comes from a public assistance program, or because the applicant has in good faith exercised any right under the Consumer Credit Protection Act. The federal agencies that administer compliance with these laws include the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, 1700 G Street NW, Washington, DC 20552, and the Federal Trade Commission, Equal Credit Opportunity, Washington, DC 20580.</p>

    <h2>20. &ldquo;Refi 36&rdquo; offer terms</h2>
    <p><strong>Offer.</strong> Stairway Mortgage offers qualified customers up to $2,500 in lender credits toward Covered Fees when they refinance a first-lien purchase or refinance mortgage (&ldquo;Mortgage Loan&rdquo;) with Stairway Mortgage within 36 months of the original closing date. Eligibility begins 180 days after the original funding date. The offer is valid only through the Stairway Mortgage branch of NEXA Mortgage LLC and cannot be redeemed through any other NEXA branch or team.</p>
    <p><strong>How the credit is provided.</strong> The credit is provided through the new loan&rsquo;s pricing as a lender credit and will be shown on your Loan Estimate and Closing Disclosure.</p>
    <p><strong>Covered Fees:</strong> lender&rsquo;s and owner&rsquo;s title insurance; appraisal, including second appraisals, re-inspections and recertifications; flood certification; credit report; and settlement fees, including notary, recording, transfer taxes, government fees, deed preparation, courier and endorsements. <strong>Not covered:</strong> discount points and any cash back to the borrower.</p>
    <p><strong>Eligibility.</strong> You must be a U.S. citizen, permanent resident or eligible non-permanent resident refinancing a primary residence in a state where NEXA Mortgage LLC is licensed; have closed your Mortgage Loan with Stairway Mortgage between January 1, 2025 and December 31, 2030; refinance within 36 months of the original closing date; and tell your loan officer about the offer before locking your rate.</p>
    <p><strong>Other terms.</strong> One refinance per Mortgage Loan. Cannot be combined with other offers. No cash value; credits cannot exceed actual Covered Fees. All loans are subject to standard underwriting and credit approval. This is not a commitment to lend. We may change or end this offer at any time without notice; rates, terms and eligibility vary by state.</p>

    <h2>21. Text messaging terms</h2>
    <p><strong>Program.</strong> By providing your mobile number and opting in, you agree to receive text messages from Stairway Mortgage about loan application updates, phone verification codes, account alerts, mortgage market updates and promotions, follow-ups on mortgage reviews, holiday messages and service referrals. Messages may be sent through platforms such as RingCentral, GoHighLevel, Telnyx, Twilio and similar providers. Consent is not a condition of any purchase or loan.</p>
    <p><strong>Frequency and cost.</strong> Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
    <p><strong>Opt out.</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to cancel; you will receive one confirmation text. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or call <a href="tel:+19549931625">(954) 993-1625</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>Mobile privacy.</strong> No mobile information or phone numbers will be shared with third parties, affiliates or partners for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third party, except the providers that deliver our messages. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

